      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This bug is easily repeatable and fairly annoying. I own many of the props 20+ so I use the wing menus to spawn them. \n\nTo reproduce the bug: Set the wing menu to be items/props. Then menu with the items/props wing shown. Each time it opens 4 - 6 props show as a hourglass loading symbol but they never load, they are non-spawnable in this state even if clicked and you know which prop to expect. To get them to show back up, the menu either has to be opened and closed, or scrolled up and down repeatedly for the items displayed as hourglasses to reveal themselves. If the menu is opened/closed, a different assortment of props are now often an unclickable hourglass symbol instead.\n\nHope this gets fixed!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
